# Spark IDE - proven ide run bind (-> ran) + print op JSON.
# After keys-miss. Unlike ask -> reply (Gravity text), run bind
# stores the op JSON line; print ran shows that JSON.
# Run: ./spark --dry-run examples/ide_run_bind.spark
# No Electron. No new asm - documents proven bind only.

ide open "examples/hello.spark"

ide run -> ran

print ran
